<title>UK: J.P. Morgan sets 150 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan sets 150 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J.P. MORGAN &amp; CO</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.50     PAY DATE   S01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   20.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5-100     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  U.S	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING OF EXISTING 250 MLN SFR BOND.</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
